# The forest spider's body (#328, D101, D102): the `dead` frame of spider.grid, pixel for pixel. Since #571 (D117, the
# author, 2026-11-21) it keeps the live spider's palette, ink contour and moon rim, exactly as the `dead` frame: no decor
# recolour, no tint, no halo. The pose, legs curled up, is the cue that it is dead (RemainsTest).
# Keep it in step with spider.grid: same keys, same colours.
size 32 16
color k 0b0814
color a 4a0c22
color b 86101f
color c 9c2050
color h 6a0e1e
color H 86101f
color f e8e0cc
color l b07c8c
color L d8b0c0
color n 8e5a6a
frame body
